          "type": "heading",
          "id": "b_h2",
          "text": "Three launches, same speed"
        },
        {
          "type": "tutor_text",
          "id": "b_t2",
          "text": "These three were thrown at exactly the same speed — only the angle differs. Two of them land in the same place. One of them goes highest. Circle the apex if you want to talk about it.",
